{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-488-r4587239","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Atkins-Friendly Mock Tiramisu","sourcePageId":488,"sourceRevision":"4587239","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:34:17Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Atkins-Friendly%20Mock%20Tiramisu&oldid=4587239","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:22:55.272Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Atkins recipes","Category:Gluten-free recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes using cocoa powder","Category:Recipes using cream cheese","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using instant coffee","Category:Vegetarian recipes","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"6bd09775fb553ea53f1f8c6789ab5672e36f3bbbb2da9997fe4ab7d3fd8d8d14","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Recipes for dessert|servings=4|time=5 minutes|difficulty=1}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Atkins Diet Cooking|Atkins Diet Cooking]] | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n\nThis preparation is loosely inspired by tiramisu, and it contains rich dairy, egg, cocoa, and coffee. However, in order to make it compatible with the Atkins diet, it does not contain refined carbohydrates. As a result, it contains no [[Cookbook:Cake|cake]], ladyfingers, or added sugar and is not a true tiramisu.\n\n==Ingredients==\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Sour Cream|sour cream]]\n*2 cups [[Cookbook:Cream Cheese|cream cheese]] (not low-fat)\n*2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] baking [[Cookbook:Chocolate|cocoa]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] instant [[Cookbook:Coffee|espresso powder]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Blend everything together until smooth.\n#Enjoy!\n\n==Warnings==\n*This recipe contains raw eggs. Please see the module on ''[[Cookbook:Egg|Eggs]]'' for possible health effects.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Atkins recipes]]\n[[category:Gluten-free recipes]]\n[[category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cocoa powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using instant coffee]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Atkins-Friendly Mock Tiramisu","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup sour cream","sourceText":"1 cup sour cream","amountText":"1 cup sour cream","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 cups cream cheese (not low-fat)","sourceText":"2 cups cream cheese (not low-fat)","amountText":"2 cups cream cheese (not low-fat)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 eggs","sourceText":"2 eggs","amountText":"2 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tbsp baking cocoa","sourceText":"2 tbsp baking cocoa","amountText":"2 tbsp baking cocoa","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tsp instant espresso powder","sourceText":"1 tsp instant espresso powder","amountText":"1 tsp instant espresso powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Blend everything together until smooth.","sourceText":"Blend everything together until smo